    {
      "fileName": "versatile-performance.json",
      "id": "jBp91q4uzwd4FeSX",
      "name": "Versatile Performance",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "jBp91q4uzwd4FeSX",
        "folder": "PjZAIwQbMpPCznpr",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Versatile Performance",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You can rely on the grandeur of your performances rather than ordinary social skills. You can use Performance instead of Diplomacy to [[/act make-an-impression statistic=performance]] and instead of Intimidation to [[/act demoralize statistic=performance]]. You can also use an acting Performance instead of Deception to [[/act impersonate statistic=performance]].</p>\n<p>In addition, you can use your proficiency rank in Performance to meet the prerequisites of skill feats that require a particular proficiency rank in Deception, Diplomacy, or Intimidation.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "polymath muse"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "bard"
            ]
          }
        },
